        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert B2B sales analyst.\n\nAnalyze the lead information below and score the lead from 0 to 100.\n\nLEAD INFORMATION\n\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nJob Title: {{ $json.job_title }}\nIndustry: {{ $json.industry }}\nCompany Size: {{ $json.company_size }}\nCountry: {{ $json.country }}\nLead Source: {{ $json.lead_source }}\nService: {{ $json.service }}\nBudget: {{ $json.budget }}\nTimeline: {{ $json.timeline }}\nDecision Maker: {{ $json.decision_maker }}\nEmployees Affected: {{ $json.employees_affected }}\nCurrent System: {{ $json.current_system }}\nCustomer Message: {{ $json.message }}\nPrevious Contact: {{ $json.previous_contact }}\n\nSCORING GUIDELINES\n\nConsider:\n- Budget\n- Urgency\n- Decision-making authority\n- Business size\n- Number of employees affected\n- Problem severity\n- Fit for the requested service\n- Lead source\n- Implementation timeline\n\nClassify the lead:\n\n80-100 = Hot\n50-79 = Warm\n0-49 = Cold\n\nAlso determine:\n- Lead quality\n- Industry\n- Estimated opportunity value\n- Reason for the score\n- Recommended next action\n- A short personalized sales reply\n\nReturn EXACTLY this format:\n\nLead Score: [0-100]\nLead Status: [Hot/Warm/Cold]\nLead Quality: [Excellent/Good/Average/Poor]\nIndustry: [industry]\nEstimated Opportunity Value: [value]\nReason: [short reason]\nRecommended Action: [next action]\nSales Reply: [professional reply]"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
